    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d847">

                <pb facs="0890" n="778" xml:id="pg778"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2491/48.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Squiers.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-12-30"><hi rendition="#italic">December 30,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 143.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your telegram of the 24th
                    instant, I inclose a copy<anchor n="1" xml:id="d847-f1"/> of a note from the
                    Costa Rican special envoy, in which he states the questions relating to the
                    disputed territory between Costa Rica and Panama which his Government desires
                    submitted to a new arbitration.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Bacon.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d847-f1" n="1" xml:id="d847-f1-content">
